sections.body:
保存为 opponent-audit.mjs，运行 node opponent-audit.mjs，无额外依赖。动作数组顺序固定为攻击、防御、抓取。旧对手概率为 [0.1,0.1,0.8]；候选一偏爱攻击，候选二每招各三分之一。完整基准池包含三种纯策略，等权抽取。

这里定义得分为“胜率＋平局率÷2”，它不是纯胜率。代码枚举九种独立出招组合，计算精确期望；没有随机采样，也没有把单轮结果当整场胜负。

```js
/**
 * @file Audit a one-round opponent pool with exact outcome probabilities.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-27
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-27
 */
/**
 * @param {number[]} p Probabilities in action or opponent order.
 * @param {number} size Required number of entries.
 * @returns {void} Throws on invalid probabilities.
 */
function distribution(p, size) {
  if (!Array.isArray(p) || p.length !== size ||
      !Array.from(p).every(x => Number.isFinite(x) && x >= 0 && x <= 1) ||
      Math.abs(p.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) - 1) > 1e-10) {
    throw new Error('Invalid probability distribution');
  }
}
/**
 * @param {number[]} p Candidate: attack, guard, grab.
 * @param {number[]} q Opponent in the same order; independent choices.
 * @returns {{win:number, draw:number, loss:number, score:number}} Exact probabilities and win + draw/2.
 */
export function duel(p, q) {
  distribution(p, 3); distribution(q, 3);
  let win = 0, draw = 0, loss = 0;
  for (let a = 0; a < 3; a++) {
    for (let b = 0; b < 3; b++) {
      const mass = p[a] * q[b];
      if (a === b) draw += mass;
      else if ((a - b + 3) % 3 === 1) win += mass;
      else loss += mass;
    }
  }
  return {win, draw, loss, score: win + draw / 2};
}
/**
 * @param {number[]} p Candidate action probabilities.
 * @param {number[][]} pool Frozen opponent policies.
 * @param {number[]} weights Predeclared opponent sampling probabilities.
 * @returns {{poolScore:number, worstPureScore:number}} Pool score and worst of all three pure responses.
 */
export function audit(p, pool, weights) {
  if (!Array.isArray(pool) || pool.length === 0) throw new Error('Empty pool');
  distribution(weights, pool.length);
  const scores = Array.from(pool, q => duel(p, q).score);
  const pure = [[1, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0], [0, 0, 1]];
  return {
    poolScore: scores.reduce((sum, score, i) => sum + weights[i] * score, 0),
    worstPureScore: Math.min(...pure.map(q => duel(p, q).score))
  };
}
const pure = [[1, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0], [0, 0, 1]];
for (const [name, p] of [
  ['attackBias', [0.8, 0.1, 0.1]],
  ['uniform', [1 / 3, 1 / 3, 1 / 3]]
]) {
  console.log(name, JSON.stringify({
    oldOpponent: duel(p, [0.1, 0.1, 0.8]),
    fullPool: audit(p, pure, [1 / 3, 1 / 3, 1 / 3]),
    againstGuard: duel(p, pure[1])
  }));
}
```

worstPureScore 总是额外检查全部三种纯对手，不仅检查传入的 pool。它的结论限定于本例单轮、独立出招、三动作对称规则。正式游戏不能只把三个数组改成三个 NPC 名字就沿用。
